  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\set.successor:of{X}]\nDeclares: Y is \\set\nwhen: X is \\set\nexpresses:\n. let: Z is \\set\n  then:\n  . have: Z \"in\"? Y\n    iff:\n    . (Z = X) \\.or./ (Z = \\singleton.set:of{X})\nDocumented:\n. written: \"X? \\cup \\left \\{ X? \\right \\}\"\n. description: \"The successor of $X$ is the set $X \\cup \\{X\\}$, whose members\n                are the members of $X$ together with $X$ itself. Starting from\n                $\\emptyset$ and repeating this step generates the natural\n                numbers.\"\nId: \"002b9914-ad06-4f5a-a3fb-803bd86e6c4b\"",
